### All prices for an asset
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/AAPL/prices

### Prices in a date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/AAPL/prices?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-03-31

### Invalid range (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/AAPL/prices?from=2026-03-31&to=2026-01-01

### Import prices (inserts new dates, overwrites existing ones)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/AAPL/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prices": [
    { "date": "2026-11-16", "close": 231.45 },
    { "date": "2026-11-17", "close": 233.10 }
  ]
}

### Invalid import (expect 400 with field errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/AAPL/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prices": [
    { "date": null, "close": -5 }
  ]
}

### Prices for an unknown asset (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/NOPE/prices
